  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli iyo ine nshita, imfumu Herodi epakutampa ukulacusha bamo aba mu lukuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaipaya Yakobo munyina kwa Yoani, yamuputulako umutwe ku lupanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo yamona ukuti ici casansamusha Abayuda, yabikapo no kwikata Petelo. Ici cacitike mu nshikunkulu yakulyamo Imikate Ishatutumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya yaikata Petelo yamuposa mu cifungo. Yaeba ne mpuka shine isha fita fine ukulakomboshanya pakumulinda. Herodi alefwaya ukumulubulwisha pa lwalala panuma ye Pasaka, inshikunkulu ya Cakucilila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ipasaka nangu inshikunkulu ya Cakucilila:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Moneni mu mashiwi ya mu Baibele ku mpela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Petelo ali mu cifungo, ulukuta lwena lwabikapofye ukulamupepelako kuli Lesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubushiku bwakutila mailo nga bwaca Herodi ali nokulubulwisha Petelo, ena Petelo alele pakati ka fita fibili, ninshi nabamukaka ne minyololo ibili. Kabili pa mpongolo ya cifungo pali fita fyalelonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe apopene malaika wa Mfumu aisa aiminina apo ali, na mu kamuputule mwabuuta tuutu ku cengelo. Elyo malaika asunka Petelo mu lubafu, amushibusha. Asosa ati, “Ima bwangu!” Awe ne minyololo yali ku maboko yakwe yapona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo malaika amweba ati, “Ale kaka umushipi obe, fwala ne ndyato shobe.” Awe efyo Petelo acita. Kabili malaika amweba ati, “Buula ne cakufimbana cobe, unkonke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petelo amukonka, afuma na mu cifungo. Lelo Petelo taishibe ukuti ifilecita malaika fyacine cine. Wena aletontonkanya ukuti alemona icimonwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bapita pa mpuka yapakubala iya fita fyalelonda, bapita na pa yabubili, basuka bafika na pa mpongolo ya cela iyakwingililamo mu musumba. Awe iciibi ca mpongolo caisukila icine ceka, bafuma. Awe bati bendeko ukukonka umusebo umo, apopene malaika aya, asha Petelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Petelo ashininkisha icicitike. Asosa ati, “Nomba nashininkisha cine cine. Ni Mfumu eintumine malaika waiko pakuti impusushe ukufuma mu minwe yakwa Herodi na kuli fyonse ifyo umushobo wa Bayuda walesubila ukucita.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya Petelo ashininkisha ifyo cili, alungama ku ŋanda yakwa Maria, nyina kwa Yoani Mako. Ekwalongene abantu abengi, balepepa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Petelo akonkonsha ku ciibi. Awe umukashana umo umubomfi ishina lyakwe ni Roda, aisa kukumfwa uulekonkonsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya aishiba ishiwi lyakwa Petelo, asansamuka nganshi. Abwelelamo ulubilo, ukwabula ukuti esuleko iciibi. Aya eba abantu ati, “Petelo ali panse pa mwinshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonse bamwasuka abati, “Ale akusabaila!” Elyo nao abikapofye ati, “Ala, cine cinefye!” Nabo bamwasuka abati, “Kanshi ninshi ni malaika wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petelo wena ninshi abikilepofye ukukonkonsha. Elyo baisulako iciibi. Awe bamumona, cabapesha na mano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petelo aimya ukuboko pakuti batalale. Elyo alabashimikilako ifyo Imfumu imufumishe mu cifungo. Abeba nokuti, “Bashimikileko Yakobo na babwananyina bonse.” Elyo afumako aya na kumbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya bwaca, ifita ifyalelinda Petelo fyasakamikwa nganshi. Fyalati, “Nga cinshi cicitike kuli Petelo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Herodi wena akonkomesha ukuti bali nokumufwaya. Lelo bafilililwafye ukumusanga. Kanshi epakulubulwisha ifita fyalemulinda, elyo apingula nokuti bafipaye. Kabili Herodi afuma mu Yudeya, aya ikala pa nshita inono mu Kesalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Herodi tabaleumfwana na bantu ba mu Turi na ba mu Sidoni. Kanshi nabo epakuyako ibumba kukumonana na Herodi. Babalilapo ukusembeleka Blasto no kwikatana nankwe, pantu ewali kangalila wa kwisano. Elyo baya kuli Herodi pakuti bomfwane nao palwa kwikala mu cibote. Pantu icalo cabo calefumya ifyakulya mu calo ca Mfumu Herodi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwasontelwe, Herodi afwala insalu shakwe ishabufumu. Aikala na pa cipuna cakwe icabufumu. Elyo alalanda ku bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu balasowesha abati, “Walandafye kwati mulungu, taulelanda nga muntunse!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apopene malaika wa Mfumu aponesha Herodi ubulwele ico ashali na mucinshi kuli Lesa. Awe imititi yalamulya, asuka afwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba ishiwi lyakwa Lesa lyene lyaya lilelundulukilakofye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
